        "text": "You can now turn time into pipe rate and rate back into time.\n\nWhole tank = 1.\nFill pipe → positive rate.\nOutlet → negative rate.\n\nBefore calculating, find the fraction that still has to be filled or emptied.\n\nNext, we combine several pipes and let their rates compete.",
